# Project Cursor directory

For this repository, the Cursor project directory is `.cursor` at the repo root (`/Users/vriesjo/Development/Home/stockio/.cursor`).

- Write plans to `.cursor/plans/`.
- Write rules to `.cursor/rules/`.
- Write skills to `.cursor/skills/`.
- Write commands, agents, and hooks under `.cursor/commands/`, `.cursor/agents/`, and `.cursor/hooks/`.

Do not leave repo plans only in `~/.cursor/plans`. If Plan Mode creates a file there, copy it into `.cursor/plans/` in the same turn.
